card.statement:
Let $\mathcal{C}$ be an admissible set of relations and $T(v)$ a $\mathcal{C}$-realization. If $T(w)\in \mathcal B_{\mathcal{C}}(T(v))$ then

\begin{equation}
E_{m1}(T(w)) \ =  \displaystyle \mathop{\sum_{k=1,\dots, m-1}}_{(i_1,\ldots,i_{m-1})\in \{
1,\ldots,k \}^{m-1}} a(w,i_1,\dots , i_{m-1})\  T(w+\varepsilon(i_1,\dots , i_{m-1})),
\end{equation}

for $m\in \{3, \dots, n+1\}$.
